<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <title>Confirmation de commande</title>
    <style>
        body.email-body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fbf7f0;
            font-family: "Hind Madurai", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .email-preheader {
            display: none !important;
            visibility: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            height: 0;
            width: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: #fbf7f0;
        }

        .email-wrapper-cell {
            padding: 24px 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(15, 20, 17, 0.08);
            border-collapse: collapse;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .email-hero {
            background: #1f5e3b;
            padding: 24px 28px;
        }

        .email-hero-title {
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: "Montserrat", Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .email-hero-sub {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #dfe9e2;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .email-content {
            padding: 28px;
        }

        .email-text {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .email-section-title {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: #0f1411;
            font-family: "Montserrat", Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .email-panel {
            background: #fbf7f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }

        .email-meta {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .email-meta-row td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e3d7;
            vertical-align: top;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #0f1411;
        }

        .email-meta-row td:first-child {
            width: 170px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1f5e3b;
            padding-right: 8px;
        }

        .email-action-table {
            margin: 16px 0 0;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-action-cell {
            background: #c9a227;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-action-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            color: #0f1411;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .email-footer {
            background: #f4efe6;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            color: #7a8c7a;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .email-link {
            color: #1f5e3b;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="email-body">
<span class="email-preheader">
    Votre commande {{ menuTitle }} a bien ete enregistree.
</span>

<table role="presentation" class="email-wrapper">
    <tr>
        <td class="email-wrapper-cell">
            <table role="presentation" class="email-container">
                <tr>
                    <td class="email-hero">
                        <h1 class="email-hero-title">Commande confirmee</h1>
                        <p class="email-hero-sub">Merci, votre demande a bien ete prise en compte par {{ appName }}.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="email-content">
                        <p class="email-text">Bonjour {{ firstName }},</p>
                        <p class="email-text">
                            Votre commande a bien ete enregistree. Nous vous recontacterons si un complement d information est necessaire.
                        </p>

                        <div class="email-panel">
                            <h2 class="email-section-title">Recapitulatif</h2>
                            <table role="presentation" class="email-meta">
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Commande</td>
                                    <td>CMD-{{ order.id }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Menu</td>
                                    <td>{{ menuTitle }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Date de prestation</td>
                                    <td>{{ order.serviceDate ? order.serviceDate|date('d/m/Y') : '-' }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Heure souhaitee</td>
                                    <td>{{ order.serviceTime ?: '-' }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Nombre de personnes</td>
                                    <td>{{ order.peopleCount ?: '-' }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Adresse</td>
                                    <td>{{ order.deliveryAddress }}, {{ order.deliveryPostalCode }} {{ order.deliveryCity }}</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr class="email-meta-row">
                                    <td>Total</td>
                                    <td>{{ (order.totalPrice / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <table role="presentation" class="email-action-table">
                            <tr>
                                <td class="email-action-cell">
                                    <a class="email-action-link" href="{{ url('app_user_profile', { tab: 'orders' }) }}">
                                        Voir mes commandes
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="email-footer">
                        {{ appName }} · <a class="email-link" href="{{ url('app_contact_index') }}">Contact</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
